    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erulean Angel: Fantasy Commander is a Grand Strategy RPG set in a stunning handcrafted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lazaric March has arrived on the shores of Erulea, bringing with it the seed of war and shattering the island nation\u2019s centuries of peace. Lead a cast of commanders as they recruit, train and mobilize the inhabitants of the land to repel the invading force, restore order, and unravel the mysteries of the Erulean Angel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>TURN BASED AUTOBATTLER COMBAT</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/ae9a4e97582ba29857da87c50ac6930b.poster.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/ae9a4e97582ba29857da87c50ac6930b.webm?t=1751724490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Devise a strategy, assemble your troops, and watch as the melee unfolds. Achieving victory on the battlefield will require you to learn each unit\u2019s strengths and identify synergies between them. Whether they\u2019re leading the charge on the frontlines, buffing and healing their allies, or suppressing the enemy with arcane magic, each unit type brings new possibilities to your arsenal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>AN INTERACTIVE WORK OF ART</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/044062b7a5bc4f32889ae40a7713f2e5.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erulean Angel: Fantasy Commander is packed with handcrafted charm. The game features over one hundred and fifty oil paintings portraying the characters and locales of Erulea, and hours of original music to bring the world to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MUSTER THE MILITIA</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/69f2ce161c7490af9dccb915af96af1e.poster.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/69f2ce161c7490af9dccb915af96af1e.webm?t=1751724490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>To defeat the March, you\u2019ll need to bolster your ranks. Inspire your fellow countrymen to join your cause, train them into specialized roles, and recruit new commanders to multiply your strategic options.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>TRAVEL THE LAND</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/5b06b7d4005c3231801a91c3527614b0.poster.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/5b06b7d4005c3231801a91c3527614b0.webm?t=1751724490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Set off across Erulea on a grand adventure. The route you take will shape your playthrough, with every road leading to new enemies to overcome, allies to recruit, and places to explore. No two journeys will be the same.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erulean Angel: Fantasy Commander is a Grand Strategy RPG set in a stunning handcrafted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lazaric March has arrived on the shores of Erulea, bringing with it the seed of war and shattering the island nation\u2019s centuries of peace. Lead a cast of commanders as they recruit, train and mobilize the inhabitants of the land to repel the invading force, restore order, and unravel the mysteries of the Erulean Angel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>TURN BASED AUTOBATTLER COMBAT</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/ae9a4e97582ba29857da87c50ac6930b.poster.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/ae9a4e97582ba29857da87c50ac6930b.webm?t=1751724490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Devise a strategy, assemble your troops, and watch as the melee unfolds. Achieving victory on the battlefield will require you to learn each unit\u2019s strengths and identify synergies between them. Whether they\u2019re leading the charge on the frontlines, buffing and healing their allies, or suppressing the enemy with arcane magic, each unit type brings new possibilities to your arsenal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>AN INTERACTIVE WORK OF ART</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/044062b7a5bc4f32889ae40a7713f2e5.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erulean Angel: Fantasy Commander is packed with handcrafted charm. The game features over one hundred and fifty oil paintings portraying the characters and locales of Erulea, and hours of original music to bring the world to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MUSTER THE MILITIA</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/69f2ce161c7490af9dccb915af96af1e.poster.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/69f2ce161c7490af9dccb915af96af1e.webm?t=1751724490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>To defeat the March, you\u2019ll need to bolster your ranks. Inspire your fellow countrymen to join your cause, train them into specialized roles, and recruit new commanders to multiply your strategic options.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>TRAVEL THE LAND</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/5b06b7d4005c3231801a91c3527614b0.poster.avif?t=1751724490\" width=616 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767110/extras/5b06b7d4005c3231801a91c3527614b0.webm?t=1751724490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Set off across Erulea on a grand adventure. The route you take will shape your playthrough, with every road leading to new enemies to overcome, allies to recruit, and places to explore. No two journeys will be the same.</p>",
